  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Somnath Sarkar vs Unknown on 13 September, 2017 Author: Joymalya Bagchi Bench: Joymalya Bagchi 1 13.09.2017 . as C.R.R. 3039 of 2017 In Re: An application under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "It is submitted on behalf of the petitioner that the registration of the criminal case under the provisions of the Indian Penal Code is unwarranted in view of the special statute, namely, Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and the rules framed thereunder. It is further submitted that the sample of adulterated food was not seized from the possession of the petitioner. Mr. Basu, learned Government Advocate, who ordinarily appears for the State, is requested to appear in the instant case for the State.",
